B.bxZ=new A.lI(B.r6,B.V1,"Purchase Invoices Table","Same structure as Sales but for purchase invoices.\n\n\u2022 GST columns here represent ITC amounts \u2014 tax you paid on purchases, which offsets your output GST.\n\u2022 Supplier column shows the supplier name linked from your records.\n\u2022 Totals row shows total ITC claimable across all slabs for the period.")
B.by5=new A.lI(B.ko,B.u9,"GST Reconciliation Tab","Gives you the component-wise GST split needed for GSTR-3B filing:\n\n\u2022 IGST \u2014 inter-state tax (buyer and seller in different states).\n\u2022 CGST \u2014 central GST (intra-state, goes to central government).\n\u2022 SGST \u2014 state GST (intra-state, goes to state government).\n\nOpening row = carry-fwd GST from snapshot.\nPeriod row = current period GST.\nCombined row = sum of both \u2014 this is what you actually file in GSTR-3B.")
